cross three immersive levels:  \n\n\ud83d\udd25 Sci-Fi Room \u2013 Smash futuristic gadgets, break high-tech screens, and shatter advanced machinery in a neon-lit sci-fi setting.  \n\ud83d\udd0d Interrogation Room \u2013 Tear apart the room, destroy interrogation equipment, and wreck everything in sight.  \n\ud83d\udee0 Garage \u2013 Smash cars, break tools, and demolish the workshop in a gritty, realistic environment.  \n\nWith satisfying physics, intense destruction mechanics, and a variety of objects to obliterate, Smash That lets you relieve stress in the most fun way possible. Are you ready to break it all? \ud83d\udca5", "short_description": "Smash That is a rage room game where you unleash destruction! Use weapons like a hockey bat, cricket bat, and crowbar to smash objects across three intense levels: the Sci-Fi Room, Interrogation Room, and Garage. Break, destroy, and let off steam in the ultimate smashing experience!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/rajgohil28/Privacy-Policies-and-Terms/blob/main/Smash-That-Privacy-Policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SpatialOS", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://spatialos.co/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8553298274767862"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 5, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1573945267133181"}